# MEGA Panel A — adding PITC to each well of the plate
# Uses P1000 with splits: 9 wells per aspiration (450uL), 11 aspirations total.
# Same single tip throughout. PITC is methanol-based so post-air gap is
# redrawn between splits to prevent dripping.

load_pipette TysonP1000.json
home

pipette 450 --tip_end keep PITC1 96wellplatePITC --prewet 5 --splits '96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50;96wellplatePITC:50'
